<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fisher Scientific cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fisher Scientific cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Fisher Scientific International Inc to neutral from outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for details.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up two to 38-3/4.</p>
</text>
